Package: myNimblePackage
Type: Package
Title: Minimal NIMBLE Model Compilation Example
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dayeon", "Kim", , "dayun0405@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A minimal worked example of wrapping 'nimble' inside an R
    package. Defines a one-node model, x ~ dnorm(0, 1), builds it with
    nimbleModel() and compiles it to C++ with compileNimble(), returning
    the compiled model object. Intended as a starting template rather
    than a general-purpose tool.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
